# The old Ischlerbahn halt in Strobl (Lokalbahn-Haltestelle), back layer,
# no outlines: a small half-timbered station building (c infill, O/l
# timber frame and braces, an O/l board wainscot with an o lit top) under
# a shallow m/d sheet roof with an O/l sawtooth fascia; a blank w/i
# station board in a d frame, a ticket window o/b/s with an O counter, a
# door O/l with b lights, a bench o/O/l, an old platform lamp (d post,
# d lantern with Y/o glass), a bicycle rack i/m with a parked bicycle (d
# wheels, S frame: it serves the cycle path now) on an i/m/d stone
# platform. Drawn = solid (D-038), the schiffsstation convention: the
# profile is the full 96x96 box, place at col 263, row 15, dx 8 (cols
# 260..265 x rows 10..15, the bottom on the row-16 top); the roof's i lip
# (rows 0-1) is the launch, row 10's top, 6 tiles above the meadow.
# Generated by the pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid is the
# source.
sprite = lokalbahn_haltestelle
size   = 96x96
origin = 48,96
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
